  "title": "全国产！超算「诺奖」5 年再回中国队",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3MTA0MTk1MA==&mid=2652744315&idx=1&sn=d46f87fe5c3d67fafd150d6db59c8bad",
  "date": "2026-11-21 11:52:00",
  "author": "新智元",
